WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.067
-Welcome, welcome, welcome,
welcome to

00:00:03.067 --> 00:00:04.200
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.334
You're here.
You made it.

00:00:05.334 --> 00:00:06.701
You're watching at home.
Thank you.

00:00:06.701 --> 00:00:11.234
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:11.234 --> 00:00:12.667
Let's get to some news, here.

00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:14.400
Well, guys,
today President Biden

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.033
hosted a summit
at the White House

00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:18.701
with the leaders of Mexico
and Canada.

00:00:18.701 --> 00:00:20.601
Yep, basically,
Mexico and Canada heard

00:00:20.601 --> 00:00:22.834
all of America blasting Adele
and wanted to check in on us.

00:00:22.834 --> 00:00:24.567
[ Laughter ]
"You guys --"

00:00:24.567 --> 00:00:26.067
That's right,
when Trump was president,

00:00:26.067 --> 00:00:28.734
the regular meeting between the
three leaders never happened.

00:00:28.734 --> 00:00:30.400
Now that it's back, it'd be wild

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:31.567
if the Mexican president
was like,

00:00:31.567 --> 00:00:33.334
"Oh, and here's a check
for that wall."

00:00:33.334 --> 00:00:36.434
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:41.167
Of course, the leaders spent
time talking about immigration.

00:00:41.167 --> 00:00:42.934
Biden complained
about the number of Mexicans

00:00:42.934 --> 00:00:44.701
coming to America.
Trudeau complained

00:00:44.701 --> 00:00:46.968
about the number of Americans
coming to Canada.

00:00:46.968 --> 00:00:48.968
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.968 --> 00:00:50.234
That's right, Biden's very busy.

00:00:50.234 --> 00:00:51.968
Tomorrow, he is going to pardon

00:00:51.968 --> 00:00:54.634
two Thanksgiving turkeys
at the White House.

00:00:54.634 --> 00:00:55.801
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:00:55.801 --> 00:00:57.133
That's what we're doing.

00:00:57.133 --> 00:00:58.334
We're pardoning turkeys, here.

00:00:58.334 --> 00:01:00.834
And they just revealed
their names.

00:01:00.834 --> 00:01:02.934
Their names are
Peanut Butter and Jelly.

00:01:02.934 --> 00:01:04.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.901 --> 00:01:07.501
Come on! After this year,
how are they not named

00:01:07.501 --> 00:01:09.133
Pfizer and Moderna,
you know what I'm saying?

00:01:09.133 --> 00:01:11.701
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:01:11.701 --> 00:01:12.767
Peanut Butter and Jelly?

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:17.801
Yeah, Peanut Butter and Jelly.

00:01:17.801 --> 00:01:19.868
Thanks to supply chain issues,
that's also

00:01:19.868 --> 00:01:21.200
what we'll be eating
on Thanksgiving.

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:23.334
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:23.334 --> 00:01:25.501
Some business news --
today CVS announced

00:01:25.501 --> 00:01:29.133
that it will close 900 stores
over the next three years.

00:01:29.133 --> 00:01:31.234
[ Audience ohs ]
Right now, JCPenney is like,

00:01:31.234 --> 00:01:32.801
"Wait, how did we make it
through the pandemic

00:01:32.801 --> 00:01:34.033
and you guys didn't?

00:01:34.033 --> 00:01:35.534
[ Laughter and applause ]
Kidding me?"

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:39.467
Sounds like a lot of closings,

00:01:39.467 --> 00:01:41.367
but all 900
of those CVS stores were

00:01:41.367 --> 00:01:42.467
on the same block.

00:01:42.467 --> 00:01:46.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.601 --> 00:01:48.801
Some more business news --
I saw that T.J.Maxx

00:01:48.801 --> 00:01:52.400
is raising prices on some
of its higher-end brands.

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:54.234
Yeah, I guess they're trying

00:01:54.234 --> 00:01:57.000
to give the whole store
a more upscale vibe.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:58.567
Check out this latest ad I saw.

00:01:58.567 --> 00:01:59.567
[ Classical music plays ]
-[ French accent ] Introducing

00:01:59.567 --> 00:02:01.667
