00:02:01.667 --> 00:02:03.667
Home of elegance...

00:02:05.734 --> 00:02:07.834
[ Laughter ]
...style...

00:02:09.834 --> 00:02:12.200
[ Laughter ]
...and sophistication.

00:02:19.701 --> 00:02:20.767
-Isn't that interesting?
Yeah.

00:02:20.767 --> 00:02:21.834
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:21.834 --> 00:02:23.534
They're changing their image.

00:02:26.801 --> 00:02:29.567
Hey, I saw that Oreo's
coming out with a new cookie,

00:02:29.567 --> 00:02:32.667
called Oreo Thins Extra Stuf.

00:02:32.667 --> 00:02:35.734
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.667 --> 00:02:40.100
What?!

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:42.300
So, basically,
they're just Oreos, right?

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:44.133
Can I see it again? Can I see
the picture of it again?

00:02:46.033 --> 00:02:47.667
At this point,
just cut out the middleman

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:49.701
and start selling
an IV bag of stuf,

00:02:49.701 --> 00:02:52.634
[ Laughter and applause ]
you know, at this point, right?
We'll do that.

00:02:52.634 --> 00:02:54.434
Hey, this is fun --
in a recent interview,

00:02:54.434 --> 00:02:56.434
Dwayne Johnson said
that he wants to be

00:02:56.434 --> 00:02:58.200
