Bond villain as carbs.

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:06.901
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.901 --> 00:03:08.801
Yeah, instead of a martini,
he'll ask the bartender

00:03:08.801 --> 00:03:10.234
