up to $20 million at auction.

00:03:19.701 --> 00:03:21.767
Wait, they're auctioning off
the Constitution?

00:03:21.767 --> 00:03:24.400
[ Laughter ]
Man, the U.S. really is
running out of money.

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:26.133
[ Laughter ]
