00:09:51.133 --> 00:09:53.934
-I give up!
I'll just eat my dog's treats.

00:09:53.934 --> 00:09:57.133
[ Laughter ]

00:09:57.133 --> 00:09:58.133
-Where are they from?

00:09:58.133 --> 00:09:59.634
-Sam's Club, of course.

00:09:59.634 --> 00:10:02.067
-Sam's Club is pulling treats
from its shelves
[ Laughter ]

00:10:02.067 --> 00:10:04.100
because they
could contain metal.

00:10:04.100 --> 00:10:06.200
-I'm. done!

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:07.501
-Come on, now,

00:10:07.501 --> 00:10:09.501
there has to be something
that you're excited about.

00:10:09.501 --> 00:10:12.968
-I mean, I did just make
that big investment.

00:10:12.968 --> 00:10:14.534
-Oh, yeah.
In what, again?

00:10:14.534 --> 00:10:17.000
-I bought 900 CVS stores.

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:18.734
[ Cheering and applause ]
-Oh, we'll be right back.

00:10:18.734 --> 00:10:20.300
I want to talk to you
during the commercial break.

